### Normalized scores (1-100)

- **Tool use: 80/100.** Evidence: Terminal-Bench Hard 65.9% (above mid-tier 45-60%), τ²-Bench 85.1% (above frontier 50%), GDPval-AA 54.4% (mid-tier). Capped by lack of verified OSWorld/AutomationBench scores 【turn0search9】.
- **Reasoning: 85/100.** Evidence: GPQA Diamond 94.1% (frontier >90%), HLE 49.5% (frontier >40%), but Intelligence Index 47.0 (below frontier 60+) and CritPt 32.3% (low). Capped by sub-frontier index and CritPt scores 【turn0search9】.
- **Context window: 0/100.** No verified public context length or long-context retrieval benchmarks found. Cannot tier without verified total context window.
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text-only input/output inferred from benchmarks; no verified image, video, PDF, or audio input scores found. Scored as text-only per methodology.
- **Coding: 80/100.** Evidence: SciCode 57.1% (above frontier 55%), Terminal-Bench Hard 65.9% (below frontier 85%), Coding Index 77.4. Capped by lack of SWE-bench Verified and DeepSWE scores 【turn0search9】.
- **Cost efficiency: 0/100.** No verified API pricing found. Cannot score without per-token cost data.
- **Overall Score: 52.0/100.** Mean of five non-cost dimensions (80+85+0+15+80)/5 = 52.0. Recommended for agentic and coding workloads where tool use and reasoning are critical, but context window and multimodal needs are limited or unverified.

